  "summary": "CHAINDROP is a self-propagating npm supply-chain worm that trojanizes packages via a package.json preinstall hook running a setup.mjs dropper, which fetches the bun runtime to execute the heavily obfuscated Math_Symbol.js/math_init.js credential stealer. It harvests developer, cloud, and AI-tooling credentials, encrypts them with AES-256-GCM plus an RSA-wrapped key, and retrieves rotating C2 endpoints from an Ethereum smart contract or GitHub dead-drop.",
